# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Explicitly exclude test sub-modules and fixtures (IMPL-0001 Phase 6).
# The allowlist above would otherwise re-include their .go files into
# the build context — harmless for the build itself (cmd/mockta is the
# only build target) but keeps the context lean.
tests/
dist/
build/
